sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as User
    participant W as Web app
    participant A as Orders API
    participant D as Database
    U->>W: Place order
    W->>+A: POST /orders
    A->>+D: INSERT order
    D-->>-A: id
    alt payment ok
        A->>A: charge card
        A-->>W: 201 created
    else payment failed
        A-->>W: 402
    end
    deactivate A
    Note right of W: shows receipt
    W-->>U: Confirmation
